<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2489_9595.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freüntlich</unclear> willig dienst, sampt waß wir ehren
<lb n="2"/>liebs unnd guots vermügen zuovor, fromm, fürsichtig,
<lb n="3"/>ehrsam, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weyß</unclear>, insonders <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guot</unclear> freünd unnd gethreüe
<lb n="4"/>lieb <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear></orgName>.
<lb n="5"/>Waß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">herr</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Ambassador <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Mÿron</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-49" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Solothurn</placeName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> wegen
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürgenomener</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verenderung</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unordnung</unclear> der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ordinari</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">botten</unclear>, so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ewer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kaufleüt</unclear> nach <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-196" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Lÿon</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abfertigend</unclear>, geschriben, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> auch hierüber sein begeren
<lb n="9"/>seÿe, habend ihr auß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beiligender</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">copia</unclear> mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mehrerem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear>-
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernemen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dessen</unclear> wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hievon</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">theilhaft</unclear> ge-
<lb n="11"/>macht, so wir nit daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besagte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kaufleüt</unclear> sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">selbsten</unclear>
<lb n="12"/>mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">einandern</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ohne</unclear> unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuethuon</unclear> wider vergleichen
<lb n="13"/>wurden, gehoffet hetten, Nach dem wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aber</unclear>
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sehen</unclear> daß solche hoffnung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vergebenlich</unclear>, unnd sie mit
<lb n="15"/>abfertigung der botten also zue continuiren gedenck-
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">en</unclear>, habend wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnseren</unclear> burgern so nach <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-196" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Lÿon</placeName> handlen
<lb n="17"/>unser meinung, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obgemelten</unclear> herren Ambassadors
<lb n="18"/>begeren fürgehalten, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> disen bericht geben,
<lb n="19"/>daß sie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> diser verenderung kein schuld tragend, unnd
<lb n="20"/>die <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-32" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Zürchen</unclear></placeName> mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wegen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ewrer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kaufleüt</unclear> sie <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beÿ</unclear>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihme</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">herren</unclear> Ambassador <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschweret</unclear> nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gestendtig</unclear> seien.
<lb n="22"/>Disem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seie</unclear> nun <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> welle, so gelangt doch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear>
<lb n="23"/>freündt: <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eüdtgnössisches</unclear> ersuochen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihr</unclear> wellend gleich
<lb n="24"/>wie wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ewre</unclear> burger die
<lb n="25"/>nach <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-196" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Lÿon</placeName> handlen dahin <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermügen</unclear>, daß die abfertig-
<lb n="26"/>ung der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ordinari</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">botten</unclear> in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alten</unclear> stand gericht
<lb n="27"/>werde. So nun solches <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnsers</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ewrn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kauf</unclear>-
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leüten</unclear> nit allein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnachtheilig</unclear>, sonder auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nutzlich</unclear> unnd
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersprießlich</unclear> ist, in dem sie wochentlich schreiben unnd
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auisen</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2489_9596.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">avisen</unclear> auß <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-131" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Franckreich</placeName> empfangen unnd dahin geben
<lb n="32"/>koennen, darnebend auch dessen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andere</unclear> ehrliche <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leüt</unclear> ohne
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">iheren</unclear> schaden <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geniessend</unclear>; alß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muegend</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sehen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weß</unclear>
<lb n="34"/>ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schein</unclear>, oder erheblich- unnd redliche ursach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">die</unclear> restitution
<lb n="35"/>der alten ordnung der ordinari botten hinderen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soll</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">i</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weliche</unclear>
<lb n="36"/>mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuegen</unclear> unsers <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erachtens</unclear> nit wuerdt koennen underlasen
<lb n="37"/>werden; <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sintemal</unclear> der herr <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Myren</unclear></persName> residierender <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ambassador</unclear>
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-49" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Solothurn</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">so</unclear> einstendig begert, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">desen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuerschrifften</unclear>,
<lb n="39"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">trostlicher</unclear> interposition <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euwre</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">burg</unclear>-
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> wegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">iherer</unclear> handlungen offt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wol</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">genossen</unclear>. Unnd
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">muegend</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">leichtlich</unclear> solche <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuefaehl</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungluek</unclear> einer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gse</unclear>-
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selschafft</unclear> insonderheit, oder allen inß gemein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuestehn</unclear>;
<lb n="43"/>daß darbey sein deß herren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ambassadors</unclear> hilffliche <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befür</unclear>-
<lb n="44"/>derung unnd gueter will, so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiedurch</unclear> underhalten
<lb n="45"/>wirdt, mehr <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wuerken</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kan</unclear>; alß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dise</unclear> verenderung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beij</unclear>
<lb n="46"/>ihme guete affection, unnd bei den handlungen fromen
<lb n="47"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nuzen</unclear> verursachen unnd mit sich bringen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wurdt</unclear>.
<lb n="48"/>So wir eüch bester <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eijdtgnoessischer</unclear> meinung zue <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sinn</unclear>-
<lb n="49"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemueth</unclear> legen; unnd darbei <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nochmahlen</unclear> freündtlich
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ersuechen</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bitten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woellen</unclear>; daß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihr</unclear> dahin bedacht
<lb n="51"/>sein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woellend</unclear>, damit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beiderfertigung</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ankunfft</unclear>
<lb n="52"/>der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ordinarij</unclear> botten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüwern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kauff</unclear>-
<lb n="53"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leüten</unclear> wie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verschiner</unclear> zeit gehalten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werde</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Darin</unclear>
<lb n="54"/>wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jhen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsers</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ortes</unclear> thuen, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> burger
<lb n="55"/>zue allem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> recht unnd billich ist, eß seie zue under-
<lb n="56"/>haltung der botten, oder <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bezahlung</unclear> der brieff-
<lb n="57"/>gelter vermoegen woellend, Daß wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear>
<lb n="58"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">g</unclear>. l. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eijdtgnossen</unclear> gueter meinung zue <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uberschriben</unclear>
<lb n="59"/>nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umbgehn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moegen</unclear>, denen wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alle</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freündt</unclear>- <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eijdt</unclear>-
<lb n="60"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnoessische</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2489_9597.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="61"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guenßigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dienßlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wllen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guete</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbarschafft</unclear>
<lb n="62"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zueerweißen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">iederzeit</unclear> geneigt. Gottes gnediger
<lb n="63"/>bewahrung unß damit samptlich woll bevelend.
<lb n="64"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Dte</unclear>. <origDate when="1624-07-17" resp="#ner">den 17. July anno 1624</origDate>.
<lb n="65"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-28" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und Raht
<lb n="66"/>der Statt Schaffhaußen</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2489_9598.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="67"/>Den frommen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuersichtigen</unclear>,
<lb n="68"/>ehrsamen, weißen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burger-
<lb n="69"/>meister unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rhat</unclear> der
<lb n="70"/>Statt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">St</unclear>. Gallen</orgName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear>
<lb n="71"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">insonders</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guoten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freunden</unclear>
<lb n="72"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrauwen</unclear> lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnossen</unclear>.
</p>
